:name: nRF52840 DK
:description: The nRF52840 DK's sw0 and led0, for Twister and renode-nrf-run.
:
: Both runners set $elf and start the emulation, so there is no `start` here.
: renode-nrf-run finds it as boards/<board>.resc, Twister through `resc:` in the variant's yaml.
:
: Renode's own nrf52840dk_nrf52840.repl is not used: its buttons lack `invert: true`, so
: the active-low sw0 reads as held from boot. The button and LED below match the DK.

set platform
"""
using "platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl"

gpio0:
    13 -> led0@0

led0: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpio0 13
    invert: true

sw0: Miscellaneous.Button @ gpio0 11
    invert: true
    -> gpio0@11
"""

using sysbus
mach create "nrf52840dk"
machine LoadPlatformDescriptionFromString $platform


macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
